Way Better Leaves 2.0.0 (NeoForge 26.2) by Luc1fer1o, declared license: MIT (META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml).

mcopt/metal/own/BushyLeaves.java and BushyLeafSource.java port its "plus" leaf geometry (PlusLeafQuadFactory,
PlusLeavesModel), its culling rule, its leaf detection and blacklist, its bushy sprite generation (OpaqueLeafSpriteSource)
and its 32x32 mask (masks/leaves_bushy.png, embedded as text) to Imagine Metal's Fabric 26.3 mesher.

